Transcript inspection found no parser bug: eight calls produced parseable tagged answers, and the sole unparsed reply visibly ended mid-reasoning without answer tags. I’m now recording the final gate run and a README that marks the result as `cap_bound`/parked; I will not fabricate G9 transcripts or call the paid hint arms after the mandated stop condition.
diff --git a/gen_1803_03302.py b/gen_1803_03302.py
